cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this construction or its exact certificates, cite this research artifact."
title: "Quantile Cycles: Strict Cycles in Finite Quantile Control"
type: software
authors:
  - name: mottopanikeiku
repository-code: "https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/quantile-cycles"
url: "https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/quantile-cycles"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An explicit family of finite quantile-projected Bellman control operators
  with strict suboptimal cycles, exact rational certificates, a Lean kernel
  check of the smallest rational instance, and a pre-specified sampled-learning
  study in which quantile-Huber updates did not reproduce a material failure.
  Earlier negative sampled evidence on a different witness is preserved.
  Research note; external peer review and priority are not established.
